OL,3,ATwo Italians killed in strike in       
OL,4,AKuwait, as Iran denies responsibility  
OL,6,FTwo Italian nationals have died        
OL,7,Ffollowing a strike on a facility in    
OL,8,FKuwait which both countries have blamed
OL,9,Fon Iran.                               
OL,11,FThe pair were technicians working for  
OL,12,FGerman arms manufacturing company      
OL,13,FRheinmetall, Italy's foreign ministry  
OL,14,Fsaid.                                  
OL,16,FIran has denied responsibility for the 
OL,17,Fattack, with Foreign Minister Abbas    
OL,18,FAraghchi saying the incident looked    
OL,19,F"suspicious" and that Tehran would work
OL,20,Fwith Kuwait and Italy to "determine the
OL,21,Fcause".                                
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
