OL,3,ATwo Italians killed in strike in       
OL,4,AKuwait, as Iran denies responsibility  
OL,6,FKuwait's defence ministry said earlier 
OL,7,Fthat four people - the two Italians, a 
OL,8,FKuwaiti national and Pakistani national
OL,9,F- had been injured from falling        
OL,10,Fshrapnel after a number of drones from 
OL,11,FIran were detected and intercepted.    
